@startuml
' /specs/002-pairwise-similarity-fix/model/sequence.puml
' Sprint: 02 | RF: RF-003
' Diagrama de Sequência — Fluxo de Serialização (Antes vs Depois)

title "Diagrama de Sequência — Serialização Pairwise Similarity\nSprint 02 | RF-003 | Antes vs Depois"

' ============================================================
' PARTICIPANTES
' ============================================================

actor "Cliente\n(Frontend)" as Client
participant "TopicRouter\napi/topic.py" as Router #LightGray
participant "AnnotationController\ncontroller/annotation.py" as Controller #LightYellow
participant "ClusterAnnotation\nmodel/annotation.py" as ClusterAnn #LightCoral
participant "PairwiseSimilarity\nutil/pairwise_similarity.py" as PairSim #LightCoral
participant "NumpyConverter\nutil/json_encoder.py" as Converter #LightGreen
participant "FastAPI\nSerializer" as Serializer #LightGray
participant "JSON\nResponse" as Response #LightGray

' ============================================================
' FLUXO COMUM (Requisição)
' ============================================================

== Requisição HTTP ==

Client -> Router: GET /topic/clusters/daired/cloning/pairwise_similarity
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Path params: username, topic, cluster_order

Router -> Router: Valida autenticação e permissões
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Verifica se username == logged_user

Router -> Controller: get_clusters(sort_by=PAIRWISE_SIMILARITY)
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Cria AnnotationController(topic, username)

Controller -> ClusterAnn: get_clusters(sort_by)
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Delega para ClusterAnnotation

ClusterAnn -> ClusterAnn: get_pairwise_cluster_similarity()
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Calcula pares de similaridade

ClusterAnn -> PairSim: get_pairwise_similarity()
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Obtém tripletos da matriz

PairSim -> PairSim: get_max_pair_similarity() em loop
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Usa numpy.argmax, numpy.unravel_index

PairSim --> ClusterAnn: [[numpy.int64, numpy.int64, numpy.float64], ...]
note right : @rf: RF-003 — 🔴 VALORES NUMPY

ClusterAnn -> ClusterAnn: Monta clusters_meta_info
note right : @rf: RF-003 — similar_cluster: numpy.int64\nsimilarity: numpy.float64

ClusterAnn --> Controller: (clusters, clusters_meta_info)
note right : @rf: RF-003 — clusters_meta_info com numpy

Controller --> Router: (clusters, clusters_meta_info)
note right : @rf: RF-003 — AMBOS contêm valores numpy\nclusters via cluster_data, cluster_selection\nclusters_meta_info via similar_cluster/similarity

' ============================================================
' RAMO: ANTES da Correção (ERRO)
' ============================================================

== 🔴 ANTES da Correção ==

Router -> Serializer: return { "clusters": c, "clusters_meta_info": cmi }
note right : @rf: RF-003 — FastAPI tenta serializar diretamente

Serializer -> Serializer: Pydantic → json.dumps()
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Tenta converter numpy.int64

Serializer -> Serializer: ❌ PydanticSerializationError
note right : @rf: RF-003 — "Unable to serialize unknown type:\n<class 'numpy.int64'>"

Serializer --> Client: HTTP 500 Internal Server Error
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Frontend recebe erro

' ============================================================
' RAMO: DEPOIS da Correção (OK)
' ============================================================

== ✅ DEPOIS da Correção ==

Router -> Router: Monta resultado completo e aplica NumpyConverter
note right : @rf: RF-003 — RF-003-C1\nresultado = {\n  \"sorting_applied\": sorting.value,\n  \"clusters\": clusters,\n  \"clusters_meta_info\": clusters_meta_info\n}\nNumpyConverter.to_native(resultado)\nconverte numpy em TODO o dicionário

Router -> Converter: to_native() recursivo

alt numpy.integer
    Converter -> Converter: int(value)
    note right : @rf: RF-003 — numpy.int64 → int
else numpy.floating
    Converter -> Converter: float(value)
    note right : @rf: RF-003 — numpy.float64 → float
else numpy.ndarray
    Converter -> Converter: value.tolist()
    note right : @rf: RF-003 — numpy.ndarray → list
else numpy.bool_
    Converter -> Converter: bool(value)
    note right : @rf: RF-003 — numpy.bool_ → bool
end

Converter --> Router: resultado_sem_numpy
note right : @rf: RF-003 — ✅ Dicionário completo sem numpy\n{clusters: [...], clusters_meta_info: {...}}\nApenas int, float, list, bool, str, dict, None

Router -> Serializer: return resultado_sem_numpy
note right : @rf: RF-003 — FastAPI serializa sem erros

Serializer -> Serializer: Pydantic → json.dumps()
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Todos os tipos são serializáveis

Serializer --> Response: HTTP 200
note right : @rf: RF-003 — JSONResponse com JSON válido

Response --> Client: { "sorting_applied": "pairwise_similarity",\n  "clusters": [...],\n  "clusters_meta_info": {...} }
note right : @rf: RF-003 — Frontend recebe dados corretos\nsem erro no console

@enduml